<para id="RM000000XOQ00JX" category="G" type-id="3001K" name-id="59146-00" from="200708">
<name>Component Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM000000XOQ00JX_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM000000XOQ00JX_01_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CCU00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Spiral Cable Sub-assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Set the spiral cable to the center position. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000QFE009X_02_0046"/>)</ptxt>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals of the spiral cable under the following conditions.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E137642J04" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
<s3>
<ptxt>After centering the spiral cable, perform the inspection at the position turned 2.5 turns clockwise and at the position turned 2.5 turns counterclockwise.</ptxt>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Set the spiral cable to the position rotated 2.5 turns clockwise from the center position, and measure while rotating it 5.0 turns counterclockwise.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
